Userspace API headers that define the ioctl interface (modules/include/dxrt_drv.h,
modules/include/dx_message.h) are additionally covered by the
"Linux-syscall-note" exception (SPDX: GPL-2.0-only WITH Linux-syscall-note), so
that userspace programs which use this interface are not considered derivative
works of the driver.

